+        # prepare()/finalize() need the identical plan for the same topk_ids;
+        # cache the last one so finalize() reuses prepare()'s instead of
+        # recomputing (the plan is costly enough that computing it twice per
+        # layer matters). Keyed by tensor IDENTITY: holding the reference
